.TH OPJ_JP3D_DUMP 1 "2026-02-21" "OpenJP3D 0.1.0" "OpenJP3D Manual"
.SH NAME
opj_jp3d_dump \- inspect a JP3D codestream
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B opj_jp3d_dump
.RB [ \-h ]
.RB [ \-\-version ]
.RB \-i\ \fIinput.jp3d\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B opj_jp3d_dump
reads a JP3D (JPEG\ 2000 Part\ 10) codestream file and prints its
marker segments, tile information, and other structural details to
standard output.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-i\ \fIfile\fR
Input JP3D codestream file (required).
.TP
.BR \-h ,\ \-\-help
Print help message and exit.
.TP
.BR \-\-version
Print version information and exit.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
opj_jp3d_dump \-i volume.jp3d
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR opj_jp3d_compress (1),
.BR opj_jp3d_decompress (1),
.BR opj_jp3d_transcode (1)
